      "modified": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.054Z",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "**One wheel of the astronomical foldout.** The page is drawn as a set of rings — a hub, a band of labelled stars, an outer rim — and the claim here is about *this* wheel and not its neighbours on the same sheet. Traced round the rim for the same reason as the rosette: a box would take in the sheet's fold and the wheel beside it.",
          "purpose": "commenting"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": "commenting",
