      "modified": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.055Z",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "The wheels on this sheet are usually read beside the herbal pages that open the book — the same hand, a different subject. That comparison page is held here beside them. ![f1r — the opening herbal leaf, for comparison](https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1006076/full/400,/0/default.jpg)",
          "purpose": "commenting"
        }
